1
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:57,320
Tianting.

2
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:58,240
It's so late.

3
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,240
What are you doing?

4
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:01,759
Auntie.

5
00:01:02,719 --> 00:01:03,799
Come with me.

6
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:11,280
Auntie.

7
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,759
Why are you in my room?

8
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:16,360
Didn't you just ask me to help you...

9
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,560
It's nothing.

10
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,439
If it's nothing, I'll be going then.

11
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:21,400
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

12
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,080
Auntie, you're usually quite busy.

13
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,280
Since you're finally here,

14
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:29,159
let me offer you a cup of ginseng tea

15
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,560
to ease your fatigue.

16
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,759
Fatigue?

17
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,560
I am feeling tired.

18
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:41,479
Tianting, why don't you rest first?

19
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,199
I'm heading back to sleep.

20
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:44,080
Auntie!

21
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,080
Drink it.

22
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:07,879
Then you can see the one you wish to see.

23
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,360
Come on.

24
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,039
No!

25
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,280
Drink it.

26
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,159
Come on.

27
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:19,840
What are you doing?

28
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,680
Stay back!

29
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,080
Brother.

30
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:28,120
It's me.

31
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,000
Tiankun.

32
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:33,759
Tiankun!

33
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:41,240
Tiankun, why are you here?

34
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,680
Tiankun.

35
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,280
Tiankun!

36
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,560
Tiankun, are you okay?

37
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,199
Tiankun, what's wrong?

38
00:03:46,199 --> 00:03:47,960
What a coincidence.

39
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,479
You're all here.

40
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:53,120
You've worked hard too, Brother.

41
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:54,599
Drink this.

42
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,840
I-I can't drink this.

43
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,560
Wait!

44
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,599
Wait!

45
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,439
Tiankun!

46
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,479
Tiankun!

47
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,000
Stay back!

48
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:21,639
Father!

49
00:04:21,639 --> 00:04:23,240
Something's wrong with Tiankun, Father!

50
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,560
Open the door!

51
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:29,160
Father, Tiankun is trying to kill me!

52
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,480
Open the door, Father!

53
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,360
Something's wrong with him!

54
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,680
Father, save me!

55
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:40,240
Tiankun... something's wrong with him!

56
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,920
Something's wrong with him!

57
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,480
Father! Father, come quickly!

58
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,480
Have you noticed something off

59
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:10,040
about those two Qi Family brothers?

60
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:13,639
Those two brothers

61
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:16,519
are scheming to lead the Qi Family.

62
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:20,680
As for that old fox, Qi Lianhai...

63
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,920
As long as I can get what I want,

64
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:26,279
I couldn't care less about the rest.

65
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,399
But now it seems,

66
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:30,199
that old fox Qi Lianhai

67
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,720
just wants me dead.

68
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:34,360
He refuses to join the other three's plan.

69
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,439
What a shortsighted family.

70
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:38,079
Right now, the Qi Family's

71
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,839
original talisman book is still missing.

72
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:44,519
And the Wan Family still hasn't shown up.

73
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:47,920
The deadline for that thing's Reckoning

74
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:50,079
on The Four Families is eight days away.

75
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,800
Who are you?

76
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,319
How did you get in here?

77
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:10,439
Eldest daughter of the Sheng Family, yes?

78
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:13,759
Heard your live-in son-in-law was stolen.

79
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:15,399
Isn't that a coincidence?

80
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:18,519
My fiancée was stolen, too.

81
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,800
Who exactly are you?

82
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:23,959
We both want to take back what's ours.

83
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,600
Why don't we sit down for a drink?

84
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:28,839
Let's have a proper chat.

85
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:41,519
The Sheng Family's proud eldest daughter

86
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:44,600
was dumped by a mere live-in son-in-law.

87
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:47,399
That brat is absolutely despicable.

88
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:50,519
Despicable. Utterly despicable.

89
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:56,560
An arrogant brat like you

90
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:59,360
daring to fight me for Mei Jiushuang?

91
00:06:59,519 --> 00:07:01,199
It's completely laughable.

92
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,600
Li Xiao.

93
00:07:05,519 --> 00:07:07,360
What did you give me to drink?

94
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,560
I'm dizzy.

95
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:13,720
I found aphrodisiac powder in your room.

96
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,439
Sheng Lingyu.

97
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:19,040
You went all out for that piece of trash.

98
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,639
Too bad he didn't take the bait.

99
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,639
What on earth...

100
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:29,160
what are you trying to do?

101
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,199
Since he has no feelings for you,

102
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:34,120
why be hung up on one person?

103
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,240
There are plenty of men in this world.

104
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,759
Perhaps one is right in front of you.

105
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:42,160
Let me run the Sheng Family for you,

106
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,639
and get revenge on that bastard.

107
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:45,360
Let go! Let go of me!

108
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,439
Let me go!

109
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,920
Let go!

110
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:52,800
Li Xiao!

111
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,240
Li Xiao, what are you doing?

112
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,240
Li Xiao!

113
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,279
Let me go!

114
00:07:57,279 --> 00:07:59,040
Get away! Li Xiao!

115
00:08:09,399 --> 00:08:10,839
Disgusting!

116
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,960
Bastard!

117
00:08:58,279 --> 00:09:00,360
I'll make you pay!

118
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,039
You... don't you try anything!

119
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,759
What do you mean "try anything"?

120
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:10,480
You're the one I married.

121
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,960
I can do

122
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:17,600
whatever I want.
